B.UI=new A.bM("To reset the map at any point, tap the the first icon in the bottom navigation bar (the compass icon). This will remove any highlights from any previously selected tag or artist. Tappable stalls on the map are shown with a slight purple colour. Black stalls are unregistered with this app.\n\n",null,null,B.B,null,null)
B.ff=new A.l(!0,null,null,null,null,null,null,B.aY,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.UO=new A.bM("Tags",null,null,B.B,null,B.ff)
B.UF=new A.bM(" have been provided by the artists themselves, and efforts have also been made by the developer to ensure that tags are accurate to the fandom titles. For example, 'How To Train Your Dragon' and other  longer titles will not be abbreviated. Please be aware of this when searching and  consider trying different variations of the title if you are having trouble finding it. \n\n",null,null,B.B,null,null)
B.ij=new A.l(!0,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,B.db,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.UD=new A.bM("Locating Tags:\n",null,null,B.B,null,B.ij)
B.UP=new A.bM('When you open the app, you will start on the main map page. To find fandoms/categories, tap the second icon in the bottom navigation bar (the tag icon) to navigate to the "Tags" page. \n\nHere, you can browse or use the search bar to find the tag you want (this can be things like Arcane, Bob\'s Burgers, Nature, Crochet, etc). \n\nYou will also see a count on the right of the tags indicating how many artists have this tag. Selecting a tag will return you to the map page, but now with the stalls highlighted GREEN with a PIN, showing where the artists with this tag are located.\n\nYou will need to zoom out and pan to find the GREEN stalls but there is a list of stall numbers on the left-hand side of the screen to aid in your navigation. \n\nTowards the left of the map (in Halls 3 and 4) you will find stalls that begin with C. Middle of the map (Hall 2) you will find stalls that begin with B. And towards the right side of the map (Hall 1) you will find stalls that begin with A.\n\nSelecting a stall will highlight it PINK with a STAR in which you can then tap the banner to view more details on that artist. \n\n',null,null,B.B,null,null)
B.US=new A.bM("Locating Artists:\n",null,null,B.B,null,B.ij)
B.UW=new A.bM('Upon opening the app, you will be on the main map page. To find specific artists, tap the third icon in the bottom navigation bar (the artist palette icon) to access the "Artists" page. \n\nYou can scroll through the artist list or search for a particular artist using the search bar (you can also search for a stall number here). \n\n Selecting an artist will take you back to the map page, where their stall location is highlighted in PINK with a STAR. You may need to zoom in/out and pan in order to find the highlighted PINK stall.\n\n Additionally, you can view detailed information about the artist by clicking on their banner underneath their highlighted stall. Their details page may also provide links to their online store/website and/or instagram. You can also view the tags assocaited with that artist, tapping on them will redirect you to the tag page where you can search for this tag directly. \n\n',null,null,B.B,null,null)
B.UN=new A.bM("\n",null,null,B.B,null,null)
B.UT=new A.bM("Dev note: ",null,null,B.B,null,B.ff)
